{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>No AI or Generative model have been used in the making of this game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>This is a passion project made by a solo developer.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>VR is available but optional.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710650/extras/f55b1eecbf9f7a9835dddf13b9f0018e.avif?t=1765354795\" width=1280 height=614 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an engineer working for the gigantic CSMO space corporation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a dimensional anomaly scatters your fleet across an unexplored star system, you find yourself alone, picking up faint residual signals in the area. Find your way across the orbits, explore the abandoned ships, uncover the mystery behind the anomaly, and survive to escape this deadly star system... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710650/extras/23d51618ff92e7525b4ae5b79b94b8cc.avif?t=1765354795\" width=1280 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Where are the other ships?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710650/extras/150389040bfdef6f8ea1bba8c365a4ff.avif?t=1765354795\" width=1280 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Is the rest of the crew still alive?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710650/extras/c58e9dfb4c7f3210b0eb09a25d47b13b.avif?t=1765354795\" width=1280 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Is there something watching me?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710650/extras/396af28a2b0a0da71a6a30ce63641d5c.avif?t=1765354795\" width=1280 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a psychedelic cosmic story <strong>in VR and in flat</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot</strong> your welding-tugship across the orbits</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the fleet wreckages <strong>board them</strong> and <strong>explore them</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>radio and computer</strong> database to retrieve and make sense of the things you find</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During on-foot phases, <strong>explore and take advantage</strong> of every system of the vessels (Electrical grid, computer network, air vents, crew emails and chats, ...) to get to your objectives</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> the Lithomorphs that have intruded the vessels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non linear</strong>, explore the environments thoroughly, each detail can have its importance. The game world is semi-open in a Metroidvania fashion</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710650/extras/3adc33ea6711a5917176707bb4b75a60.avif?t=1765354795\" width=1280 height=650 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make your next career move, join CSMO!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2710650?t=1765354795","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710650/220b4a8787ad4719b58102bb9724f8cd04166799/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765354795","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765354795","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765354795","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>No AI or Generative model have been used in the making of this game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>This is a passion project made by a solo developer.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>VR is available but optional.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710650/extras/f55b1e